<Para>
<Text><Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/1998/41" id="c00003" Year="1998" Number="41" Class="UnitedKingdomPublicGeneralAct">1998 c. 41</Citation>. <Emphasis>See</Emphasis> section 146(6) for the definition of “prescribed”. Paragraph 1 of Schedule 9 was amended by paragraph 89(2) of Schedule 13 to the Tribunals, Courts and Enforcement Act <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/2007/15" id="c00004" Year="2007" Number="15" Class="UnitedKingdomPublicGeneralAct">2007 (c. 15)</Citation>. Paragraph 2(2)(h) of Schedule 9 was amended by sections 139 and 194(4) of, and paragraphs 1, 44(1) and (3) of Schedule 5 and Part 2 of Schedule 12 to, the Local Government and Housing Act <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/1989/42" id="c00005" Year="1989" Number="42" Class="UnitedKingdomPublicGeneralAct">1989 (c. 42)</Citation> and section 8(1) and (3) of the Local Government Finance Act <Citation URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/2012/17" id="c00006" Year="2012" Number="17" Class="UnitedKingdomPublicGeneralAct">2012 (c. 17)</Citation>.</Text>
</Para>
</FootnoteText>
</Footnote><Footnote id="f00002">
